      "content": "i get the age thing, but i'm asking about the \"vibe\" and background of the groups. for instance, when we have groups coming in from the local neighborhood—you know, the more diverse, urban areas nearby—the security team feels like they need to be much more vigilant compared to when we have high-end travelers. is there any data or common professional advice that supports focusing more surveillance on these specific cultural groups to prevent incidents before they happen? i just want to make sure we're being proactive about the safety of our more premium guests.",
